      "original_position": 1,
      "content": "请使用中文回复，除非用户明确使用其他语言。\n\n帮我把下面这段话翻译成英文: Jane 你好,  红色的285是我根据1%算好的\n\n但是汇率我没办法确认所以美元没折算"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_304ba9918572:msg_2",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 28642,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 2,
      "original_position": 2,
      "content": "Hi Jane,\n\nThe 285 in red is what I calculated based on the 1%. However, since I couldn't confirm the exchange rate, I didn't convert it into US dollars.\n\n---\n\n如果你想要更正式或更随意的语气，我也可以调整。比如更口语化的版本：\n\n> Hi Jane, the 285 marked in red was calculated using the 1% rate. As for the USD figure, I left it unconverted because I couldn't verify the exchange rate."
    }
